// THE VETERAN'S STEPS, BAKED FROM THE ART CHAT'S MOVES (src/dev/veteran_moves.ts) by tools/bake_veteran.ts: DO NOT EDIT BY
// HAND; run `npx tsx tools/bake_veteran.ts` again when his moves change (tests/veteran_art.test.ts checks them against the art).
// For every move by its id, frame 0 to `long` (thirty a second at his pace), along his forward and to his left as the move
// began, in TILES (the art's measure / VET_TILE):
//   carry   how far the art has carried him (carryAt)
//   place   where the floor point under him is, from where he stood (placeOf: the carry, and the swing of a turn made about
//           a pivot foot, the spinning elbow's): carry him HERE, and his frame, drawn from his floor point, is where the art has
//           him, his feet held on the floor
//   spin    his whole turn, degrees to his left (spinAt)
// On the game's floor his forward is (fx, fy) and his left (fy, -fx); a picture drawn mirrored (fx - fy < 0, as the game
// mirrors a hero facing screen-left) has his left on the world's right: (-fy, fx).

